: SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
: Stage 1 unsigned 64-bit non-trapping overflow and division predicates.
ns std/math/u64.

: Maximum unsigned 64-bit integer (2^64 - 1).
: @dc l8589978260
pub u64/MAX u64:18446744073709551615.

: Returns true iff checked `add lhs rhs` will not overflow unsigned 64-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978261
pub v/b/canAdd u64/lhs u64/rhs
    test
        in u64:18446744073709551615 u64:0
        out true.
        in u64:18446744073709551615 u64:1
        out false.
        in u64:9223372036854775808 u64:9223372036854775807
        out true.
        in u64:9223372036854775808 u64:9223372036854775808
        out false.
    ge wrapAdd u64/lhs u64/rhs u64/lhs.

: Returns true iff checked `sub lhs rhs` will not underflow unsigned 64-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978262
pub v/b/canSub u64/lhs u64/rhs
    test
        in u64:5 u64:5
        out true.
        in u64:5 u64:6
        out false.
        in u64:0 u64:1
        out false.
    ge u64/lhs u64/rhs.

: Returns true iff checked `mul lhs rhs` will not overflow unsigned 64-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978263
pub v/b/canMul u64/lhs u64/rhs
    test
        in u64:4294967295 u64:4294967297
        out true.
        in u64:4294967296 u64:4294967296
        out false.
        in u64:18446744073709551615 u64:0
        out true.
        in u64:18446744073709551615 u64:1
        out true.
    if eq u64/rhs u64:0
        true
        eq div wrapMul u64/lhs u64/rhs u64/rhs u64/lhs.

: Returns true iff checked `div lhs rhs` and `rem lhs rhs` will not fault (`rhs != 0`).
: @dc l8589978264
pub v/b/canDiv u64/lhs u64/rhs
    test
        in u64:10 u64:2
        out true.
        in u64:10 u64:0
        out false.
        in u64:0 u64:0
        out false.
    ne u64/rhs u64:0.
